        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Aries &mdash; 2nd Technique, gained at level 6.</em></p><p><em>Mu's art: the thing is not broken, it is sent away.</em></p><p>The target must attempt a Will save.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> It is teleported 60 feet in a direction you choose, arriving in the nearest open space.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> It is teleported 250 feet, lands prone, and takes @Damage[3d6[force]] damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 and the failure distance by 30 feet.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
